ircle></svg><span><strong>Layoff &amp; Benefits</strong><small>Deadlines, coverage, and runway.</small></span></a></div></div></div><a href="/employers">For Employers</a><a href="/pricing">Pricing</a><div class="mh-nav-group"><button type="button" class="mh-nav-trigger" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_reactId_-panel" data-active=""><span>Resources</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="mh-nav-panel" id="_reactId_-panel" hidden="" data-columns="2"><a class="mh-nav-feature" href="https://newsletter.offboard.co"><strong>The Offboard Newsletter</strong><span class="mh-nav-feature-visual"><img alt="" loading="eager" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" style="position: absolute; height: 100%; width: 100%; left: 0px; top: 0px; right: 0px; bottom: 0px; color: transparent;" sizes="300px" srcset="/_next/image?url=%2Fmarketing%2Fhomepage%2Fraw%2Fhero-real-life.webp&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 32w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmarketing%2Fhomepage%2Fraw%2Fhero-real-life.webp&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 48w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmarketing%2Fhomepage%2Fraw%2Fhero-real-life.webp&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 64w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmarketing%2Fhomepage%2Fraw%2Fhero-real-life.webp&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 96w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmarketing%2Fhomepage%2Fraw%2Fhero-real-life.webp&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 128w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmarketing%2Fhomepage%2Fraw%2Fhero-real-life.webp&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmarketing%2Fhomepage%2Fraw%2Fhero-real-life.webp&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmarketing%2Fhomepage%2Fraw%2Fhero-real-life.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmarketing%2Fhomepage%2Fraw%2Fhero-real-life.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fmarketing%2Fhomepage%2Fraw%2Fhero-real-life.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/